{"ticker":{"symbol":"107590.KS","name":"미원홀딩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":56000.0,"change_pct":0.0,"market_cap":129665196032.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0125,"week52_low":52400.0,"week52_high":70400.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"South Korea","city":"Yongin-si","employees":21,"website":"https://miwonsc.com","business_summary":"Miwon Holdings Co., Ltd., an investment holding company, engages in rental and merchandise wholesale and retail, hardened resin, and surfactant businesses in South Korea and internationally. The company provides chemical products for UV/EB curing, such as acrylate and methacrylate monomers, oligomers, benzoins, and epoxy diluents; photosensitizers, UV stabilizers, and antioxidants; sulfur derivatives and sulfonic acid; nonionic, anionic, and cationic surfactants; cobalt adhesion promoters under the Corebond brand; bead-type resins and peptides; and inkjet applications and printed electronics. The company was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Yongin-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"투자지주회사인 미원홀딩스(주)는 국내외에서 렌탈 및 상품 도소매, 경화수지, 계면활성제 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 아크릴레이트 및 메타크릴레이트 모노머, 올리고머, 벤조인, 에폭시 희석제 등 UV/EB 경화용 화학 제품을 제공합니다. 감광제, UV 안정제 및 항산화제; 황 유도체 및 술폰산; 비이온성, 음이온성 및 양이온성 계면활성제; Corebond 브랜드의 코발트 접착 촉진제; 비드형 수지 및 펩타이드; 잉크젯 응용 분야 및 인쇄 전자 장치 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 1959년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 용인시에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"특수화학","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":499293421100.0,"operating_income":22840986940.0,"net_income":20180544590.0,"eps":8717.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":443162257770.0,"operating_income":15564411210.0,"net_income":13215481080.0,"eps":5708.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":476575958590.0,"operating_income":23033364540.0,"net_income":25251452630.0,"eps":10906.0},{"period